    <node id="namaskara from bangalore international airport limited. thank you for contacting us. if you need buggy service inside the terminal, complimentary buggy assistance is available for senior citizens, expectant mothers, and passengers with reduced mobility or injury. it is available in both terminals, and the service points are placed at arrival and departure areas for easier movement through the airport. **terminal 1 options** &gt; **buggy service zone: terminal 1 - landside / departure and arrival support available at prm drop-off location lane 2, prm drop-off location lane 3, the elevated walkway, opposite to arrival gate 10, opposite to hamleys outlet, and next to rare planet._x000d_ reference: click here for more details_x000d_ terminal 2 options_x000d_ _x000d_ buggy service zone: terminal 2 - landside / departure and arrival support available at level 3: departure, lane 1, prm drop-off area next to the carebyblr counter, departure after security near orientation garden, departure post security near starbucks, arrival exit gates, domestic arrival exit near baggage claim, and level 0: arrival exit._x000d_ reference: click here for more details_x000d_ if you are travelling with reduced mobility, the airport also has wheelchair assistance support, and the airline may need to be informed in advance for the best coordination.">
