    </edge>
    <edge source="...own electric wheelchair" target="namaskara from bangalore international airport limited. thank you for contacting us. if you are travelling with your own electric wheelchair, please inform your respective airline in advance so they can coordinate the required process and approvals with blr airport. for wheelchair assistance, the request should be placed at the time of booking or at least 48 hours before travel. **wheelchair assistance** &gt; **wheelchair assistance** &gt; **zone:** special assistance - wheelchair assistance &gt; passengers requiring wheelchair assistance at blr airport must place a request with the respective airlines at the time of booking tickets or 48 hours prior to their travel. passengers using personal wheelchairs are requested to contact the respective airlines in advance regarding the processes and approvals. there are dedicated zones reserved for passenger drop-off and pick-up when availing wheelchair assistance at blr airport. please speak to the on-ground team for assistance. &gt; **reference:** [click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/wheelchair-assistance) **mobility assist** &gt; **mobility assist** &gt; **zone:** special assistance - mobility assist &gt; seamless mobility support for people with disabilities. this service helps make boarding and deplaning comfortable and dignified, with smooth transfers and coordinated support in partnership with your airline. please inform your airline at least 24 hours prior to departure. &gt; **reference:** [click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/mobility-assist) if you would like, i can also help you with the nearest wheelchair assistance counter or the prm drop-off locations in t1 or t2." id="elicits">
      <data key="d4">elicits</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="...buggy service inside terminal" target="buggy service" id="asks_about">
      <data key="d4">asks_about</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="...buggy service inside terminal" target="namaskara from bangalore international airport limited. thank you for contacting us. if you need buggy service inside the terminal, complimentary buggy assistance is available for senior citizens, expectant mothers, and passengers with reduced mobility or injury. it is available in both terminals, and the service points are placed at arrival and departure areas for easier movement through the airport. **terminal 1 options** &gt; **buggy service zone: terminal 1 - landside / departure and arrival support available at prm drop-off location lane 2, prm drop-off location lane 3, the elevated walkway, opposite to arrival gate 10, opposite to hamleys outlet, and next to rare planet._x000d_ reference: click here for more details_x000d_ terminal 2 options_x000d_ _x000d_ buggy service zone: terminal 2 - landside / departure and arrival support available at level 3: departure, lane 1, prm drop-off area next to the carebyblr counter, departure after security near orientation garden, departure post security near starbucks, arrival exit gates, domestic arrival exit near baggage claim, and level 0: arrival exit._x000d_ reference: click here for more details_x000d_ if you are travelling with reduced mobility, the airport also has wheelchair assistance support, and the airline may need to be informed in advance for the best coordination." id="elicits">
      <data key="d4">elicits</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
